WEBVTT

NOTE
Galbadian motorcycle assault — armored troops deploy down a ramp.
Duration: approximately 22 seconds.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.040
A gloved hand twists a motorcycle throttle.

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:10.850
A squad of armored riders pours down a ramp from the airborne Garden.

00:00:13.270 --> 00:00:17.170
Their motorcycles leap into the sky over the countryside.

00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:21.770
The Galbadian assault force attacks.
